{"ID":"20240118151142-b2kmtkl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151142-b2kmtkl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151142-b2kmtkl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151142-975ybd8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125424-rr3un9q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125420-ok96fvy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:269,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:269\u0026#125;","title":"176狗脊","type":"doc","updated":"20240201090219"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151142-975ybd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151142-975ybd8","updated":"20240122125350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治腰背强。关机缓急，周痹，寒湿膝痛。颇利老人。一名百枝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125352-77hnpcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125352-77hnpcl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山野湿地自生之宿根草，根黑色，长而多岐似狗脊，故名。【性味】味苦甘，性微温（或作平），无毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125357-lslmn7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125357-lslmn7b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】狗脊为益气血，强筋骨要药，功能治肝虚肾亏，脚弱腰痛，筋肉拘急，失溺淋露。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125403-6568oiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125403-6568oiq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗失溺不节，男女脚弱腰痛，风邪淋露，少气，目暗，坚脊，利俯仰，女子伤中关节重。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125404-6ev5h67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125404-6ev5h67"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】男子女人毒风软脚，肾气虚弱，续筋骨，补益男子。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125406-cbx47cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125406-cbx47cu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】去寒湿，强筋骨。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125408-8exj06c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125408-8exj06c"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通钱半至三四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125409-2hoyrfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125409-2hoyrfe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】肾虚有热，小水不利或短涩黄赤，口苦舌干，均忌，恶香附败酱草。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125350-ujgv347","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125350-ujgv347"}},{"ID":"20240122125410-qfrir2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125410-qfrir2o"}},{"ID":"20240122125410-xtekg7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125410-xtekg7g","updated":"20240201090046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来是狗脊。注意，这个药，切下来的时候你看它侧面的样，就像狗，一只狗，还有根黄线在里面，好像脊椎骨一样，那就是狗脊。这里你们注明一下（黄芩：去肝胆火，下热利，呕吐，心下痞，这个都是主要的治证）。狗脊，这个狗脊呢也是很多，很便宜的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125416-t8wol02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125416-t8wol02","updated":"20240201090121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那诸位看它的性味，狗脊呢，是味苦甘，性微温。它的主治呢是益气血，强筋骨的，能够治肝虚肾亏，通通可以使用。是老人的病。那你看好，前面本经的原文，它治腰脊强，关机缓急，周痹，寒湿膝痛，颇利老人。一名叫做百枝。这个“关机”呢，就是，你看老人走路很慢，动作，关节很紧，都可以使用狗脊，狗脊是滋补的药。强筋骨的要药。筋骨太弱了，没事就可以煮一些狗脊来吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125420-ok96fvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125420-ok96fvy","updated":"20240201090219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个《甄权》呢，它说脚软，毒风，肾气虚弱，续筋骨，补益男子。它能够去寒湿。所以狗脊这个药，药性是温的，我们可以当滋补的药，常常可以开，常常都可以使用它。尤其男人吃了，因为补肝补肾嘛，你们吃这种中药，绝对会比外面那个第四台，我回来看那个第四台，不得了，哇，那个很凶哦，那个都不行的，那个可能骗得了一般人，也骗不了你们，当然更骗不了我嘛。他们在那边讲，对我来说真是胡说八道，第四台不得了，那个太可怕了，你不要去听他的。好，这个《神农本草经》上面的药，这个说可以滋补的药，的确是可以滋补，因为这经过我们历代的名医使用的，都可以用。所以说绝对没有问题的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125424-rr3un9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125424-rr3un9q"}}]}